hes<br></li><li> Detailed backgrounds and CGs<br></li><li> 1080p display<br></li><li> An original soundtrack with 18 unique pieces<br></li><li> Very long, frilly dresses<br></li><li> Victorian maids(!!!)</li></ul>",
